---
// FPT 2025 audited balance sheet (Cash + term deposits vs financial debt) contrasted against a fragile high-debt benchmark.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 295;
---
<figure class="sbp6-bs">
  <div class="sbp6-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparing FPT's audited 2025 Balance Sheet (10,522B Cash + 29,631B Term Deposits = 40,153B vs 21,074B total borrowings = +19,080B Net Cash) against a fragile high-debt structure.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp6-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Minute 1–2 Balance Sheet Radar: FPT 2025 audited cash vs debt benchmark</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phút 1–2 Soi Cân đối kế toán: số liệu kiểm toán FPT 2025 đối chiếu mẫu rủi ro</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left: Real FPT 2025 Audited */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="420" height="218" rx="10" class="sbp6-card-green" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="74" y="88" class="sbp6-hdr sbp6-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>FPT 2025 Audited (Form B 01 – DN/HN)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>FPT 2025 Kiểm toán (Mẫu B 01 – DN/HN)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="122" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Cash (110) + Deposits (120): 10,522B + 29,631B = 40,153B</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Tiền (110) + Gửi NH (120): 10.522 + 29.631 = 40.153 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="150" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Receivables (130) + Inv (140): 14,402B + 2,194B (low inv.)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Phải thu (130) + Tồn kho (140): 14.402 + 2.194 tỷ (rất gọn)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="178" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Financial Debt (320 + 338): 19,170B + 1,904B = 21,074B</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Nợ vay (320 + 338): 19.170 + 1.904 = 21.074 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="38" y1="202" x2="420" y2="202" class="sbp6-sep" />
      <text x="38" y="232" class="sbp6-sub sbp6-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Net Cash = +19,080B → deposit income beats interest cost</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền ròng +19.080 tỷ → lãi gửi 2.977B &gt; lãi vay 810B</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Fragile Benchmark */}
      <rect x="460" y="54" width="420" height="218" rx="10" class="sbp6-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={488} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="514" y="88" class="sbp6-hdr sbp6-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Fragile Benchmark (Stress Pattern)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mẫu Căng Thanh Khoản (Dấu hiệu rủi ro)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="122" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Cash + Term Deposits: 35B VND (thin 3.5% buffer)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Tiền mặt + Tiền gửi: chỉ 35 tỷ trên 1.000 tỷ tài sản</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="150" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Receivables + Inventory: 710B VND (71% tied up!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Phải thu + Tồn kho: 710 tỷ (kẹt tới 71% tài sản!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="178" class="sbp6-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Financial Debt (mostly 320 short-term): 540B VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Nợ vay tài chính (chủ yếu mã 320 ngắn hạn): 540 tỷ</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="478" y1="202" x2="860" y2="202" class="sbp6-sep" />
      <text x="478" y="232" class="sbp6-sub sbp6-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Net Debt = 505B (14× cash) → vulnerable when rates rise</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nợ ròng 505 tỷ (gấp 14 lần tiền) → cực nhạy lãi suất!</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>In FPT's 2025 audited Balance Sheet above, 74% of its cash pile sits in Code 120 (Short-term bank deposits: 29,631B) rather than Code 110 (10,522B) — skipping Code 120 understates true liquidity by nearly three-quarters.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trên BCTC hợp nhất kiểm toán 2025 của FPT ngay phía trên, 74% lượng tiền mặt nằm ở mã 120 (Tiền gửi ngân hàng có kỳ hạn: 29.631 tỷ) thay vì mã 110 (10.522 tỷ) — bỏ qua mã 120 sẽ đánh giá thiếu tới gần ba phần tư lượng tiền thật.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp6-bs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp6-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp6-bs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp6-bs text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp6-title { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp6-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp6-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp6-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp6-body { font-size: 12.2px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp6-sub { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp6-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp6-bs figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
